WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.230
A new disease spreads
through a country's crops.

2
00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:04.740
The rainy season fails.

3
00:00:04.790 --> 00:00:07.210
People's diets change.

4
00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:10.390
Any one of these can leave
a country short of food.

5
00:00:10.440 --> 00:00:14.530
And all the while, the number
of people to feed keeps rising.

6
00:00:14.580 --> 00:00:18.030
So what does it take to keep
a growing population fed?

7
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.230
In this mission, you'll find
out what food security really

8
00:00:21.280 --> 00:00:21.820
means.

9
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:23.690
You'll look at the threats to it,

10
00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.040
from new pests and diseases
to a changing environment.

11
00:00:27.090 --> 00:00:28.910
And you'll weigh up solutions,

12
00:00:28.960 --> 00:00:32.590
including biotechnology and
genetically modified crops.

13
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:35.450
Your mission: work out what
it takes to keep a growing

14
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.210
population fed.
